# Drupal 12.0.0-beta1 is blocked in phase 0: drush 13 (the only drush) requires
# guzzlehttp/guzzle ^7, every 7.x release is blocked by packagist security
# advisories, and the 12.0 lock pins guzzle 8. The site cannot be installed or
# have fu_queue_test enabled without drush. Next: Drupal core's own CLI installer
# (core/scripts/drupal install) plus a bootstrapped module-enable script, or a
# drush release on guzzle 8. Details in docs/progress.md.
